@startuml Forum_Activity_01_Registration_OTP
title Forum Platform - Activity Diagram 01: Registration with OTP (DEC-001 Reconciled)
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Guest opens registration page;
:Enter username, email, password;
:Submit registration form;

:Validate required fields and password policy;
if (Input valid?) then (Yes)
  :Check username and email uniqueness;
  if (Account or email already registered?) then (Yes)
    :Send notification email\n("Account already exists / Reset password link");
    :Return neutral 202 Accepted;
    :Display OTP entry / check email prompt;
    stop
  else (No)
    :Hash password with Argon2id;
    :Generate 6-digit OTP and 5-minute expiry;
    :Save pending registration and OTP hash;
    :Send verification OTP email;
    :Return neutral 202 Accepted;
    :Display OTP entry prompt;

    repeat
      :Guest enters OTP;
      :Verify OTP, expiry, and attempt count;
      if (OTP valid and unexpired?) then (Yes)
        :Create user account in users.accounts;
        :Consume pending registration;
        :Display registration success;
        stop
      else (No)
        if (OTP expired or 5 failed attempts reached?) then (Yes)
          :Offer resend OTP or restart registration;
          if (Resend allowed?) then (Yes)
            :Check resend cooldown (60 sec)\nand max resends (3 times);
            if (Resend quota available?) then (Yes)
              :Generate and save new OTP;
              :Send new OTP email;
            else (No)
              :Require registration restart or wait;
              stop
            endif
          else (No)
            stop
          endif
        else (OTP incorrect)
          :Increment failed attempt counter;
          :Display invalid OTP error;
        endif
      endif
    repeat while (Pending registration active?) is (Yes)
    -> No;
    stop
  endif
else (No)
  :Display field validation errors (422);
  stop
endif
@enduml

@startuml Forum_Activity_02_Login_Session
title Forum Platform - Activity Diagram 02: Login and Session
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Enter login (username/email) and password;
:Submit login form;
:Apply rate limit check;
if (Request allowed?) then (Yes)
  :Find account by normalized login and verify password;
  if (Credentials valid?) then (Yes)
    :Check account ban status;
    if (Account active?) then (Yes)
      :Create opaque session token;
      :Persist session (idle 4h, absolute 24h);
      :Set HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Lax cookie;
      :Redirect to forum dashboard;
      stop
    else (No, account banned)
      :Deny login (403 Account Restricted);
      :Show ban reason and duration;
      stop
    endif
  else (No)
    :Record failed login attempt;
    if (Failed attempts >= 5?) then (Yes)
      :Require CAPTCHA / additional throttling;
    endif
    :Show generic credential error (401);
    stop
  endif
else (No)
  :Return 429 Rate Limited;
  :Show retry-after guidance;
  stop
endif
@enduml

@startuml Forum_Activity_03_Create_Thread
title Forum Platform - Activity Diagram 03: Create Thread (DEC-003 Reconciled)
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Member drafts title, body, category, tags;
:Submit create-thread request with session, CSRF, and Idempotency-Key;
:Validate session and account status;
if (Authenticated and active?) then (Yes)
  :Validate title (10-150 chars), body (>=20 chars), max 5 tags;
  :Check thread cooldown (60 sec);
  if (Payload valid and cooldown passed?) then (Yes)
    if (Images attached?) then (Yes)
      :Verify image_ids exist in content.attachments;
      :Ensure attachments belong to member and are pending;
    endif
    :Insert thread in content.threads\n(status='published', is_locked=false, is_pinned=false);
    :Mark attachments as linked to thread;
    :Write ThreadCreated event to transactional outbox;
    :Commit transaction;
    :Return 201 Created with thread schema;
    fork
      :Search Service consumes event\nand updates search index;
    fork again
      :Notification Service consumes event\nand notifies subscribers;
    end fork
    :Display created thread to member;
    stop
  else (No)
    :Return validation or cooldown error;
    stop
  endif
else (No)
  :Return 401 or 403;
  stop
endif
@enduml

@startuml Forum_Activity_04_Comment_Reply
title Forum Platform - Activity Diagram 04: Comment and Reply
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Member enters comment or reply;
:Submit request with session, CSRF, and Idempotency-Key;
:Validate session and member permissions;
if (Authenticated?) then (Yes)
  :Validate comment length (>=1 char) and cooldown (15 sec);
  :Check target thread is open (is_locked=false);
  if (Thread open and cooldown passed?) then (Yes)
    if (Reply to parent comment?) then (Yes)
      :Validate parent belongs to same thread;
      :Verify depth level (max 2 levels allowed);
      if (Parent valid?) then (Yes)
        :Insert reply comment;
      else (No)
        :Reject reply (400 validation error);
        stop
      endif
    else (Top-level comment)
      :Insert comment;
    endif
    :Write CommentCreated event to transactional outbox;
    :Commit transaction;
    :Return 201 Created;
    :Notification Service notifies thread author / replier;
    stop
  else (No)
    :Return locked thread or cooldown error;
    stop
  endif
else (No)
  :Return 401 Unauthorized;
  stop
endif
@enduml

@startuml Forum_Activity_05_Vote_BestAnswer
title Forum Platform - Activity Diagram 05: Vote and Best Answer (DEC-002, DEC-003)
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Member clicks upvote or downvote (+1 / -1);
:Validate session;
if (Authenticated?) then (Yes)
  :Fetch target content state and author (via internal REST/cache);
  if (Target exists and is not member's own content?) then (Yes)
    :Read existing vote for voter and target;
    if (Vote already exists?) then (Yes)
      if (New value equals existing value?) then (Yes)
        :Delete vote (cancel vote);
      else (No)
        :Update vote to new value;
      endif
    else (No)
      :Insert new vote;
    endif
    :Record net reputation change in reputation_ledger;
    :Write outbox event;
    :Commit transaction;
    :Return 200 OK with new score and user vote state;
    stop
  else (No)
    :Reject vote (400 SELF_VOTE_NOT_ALLOWED or 404);
    stop
  endif
else (No)
  :Return 401 Unauthorized;
  stop
endif

newpage
title Forum Platform - Activity Diagram 05B: Mark Best Answer
start
:Thread author selects a comment as best answer;
:Validate session;
if (Authenticated?) then (Yes)
  :Verify requester is thread author;
  :Verify category is Q&A type;
  :Verify thread is not locked (is_locked=false);
  :Verify comment belongs to this thread;
  if (All preconditions pass?) then (Yes)
    :Set best_answer_comment_id on thread;
    :Write BestAnswerChanged event to outbox;
    :Commit transaction;
    :Return 200 OK;
    :Interaction Service awards reputation bonus to author;
    stop
  else (No)
    :Return 400 or 403 error;
    stop
  endif
else (No)
  :Return 401 Unauthorized;
  stop
endif
@enduml

@startuml Forum_Activity_06_Report_Moderation
title Forum Platform - Activity Diagram 06: Abuse Report and Moderation (DEC-004 Reconciled)
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Member selects target (thread, comment, or account) and reason;
:Submit report with session, CSRF, and Idempotency-Key;
:Validate session;
if (Authenticated?) then (Yes)
  :Check active report duplicate (status IN ('pending', 'reviewing'));
  if (Active report already exists for reporter & target?) then (Yes)
    :Return 409 DUPLICATE_REPORT;
    stop
  else (No)
    :Insert report with status='pending';
    :Return 201 Created with Report schema;
    stop
  endif
else (No)
  :Return 401 Unauthorized;
  stop
endif

newpage
title Forum Platform - Activity Diagram 06B: Moderator Resolution
start
:Moderator reviews pending queue in moderation queue;
:Select report to investigate;
:Choose action (lock, delete, ban, dismiss);
:Submit action with CSRF;
:Save action to moderation.actions (correlated with report_id);
:Update report status to 'actioned' or 'dismissed';
if (Action affects content?) then (Yes)
  :Call Content Service / emit event to apply status change;
endif
if (Action affects account?) then (Yes)
  :Call User Service / emit event to ban account and revoke sessions;
endif
:Emit ModerationActionApplied event to outbox;
:Commit transaction;
:Notify affected user if policy requires;
:Display resolution confirmation;
stop
@enduml

@startuml Forum_Activity_07_Search
title Forum Platform - Activity Diagram 07: Search Visible Threads
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Visitor enters search query and filters;
:Validate and normalize query;
if (Query valid?) then (Yes)
  :Execute full-text search on search.documents;
  :Filter only visible threads (status='published');
  :Apply ranking and opaque cursor pagination;
  :Return 200 OK with SearchPage;
  stop
else (No)
  :Return 422 Validation Error;
  stop
endif
@enduml

@startuml Forum_Activity_08_View_Count_Propagation
title Forum Platform - Activity Diagram 08: View Count Tracking & Propagation (DEC-005)
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Visitor opens thread page;
:Client sends POST /threads/{id}/view with session or IP HMAC;
:Interaction Service checks thread_views table within 30-minute window;
if (View already recorded in window?) then (Yes)
  :Deduplicate (no view count increment);
  :Return 204 No Content;
  stop
else (No, new view)
  :Record view in interactions.thread_views;
  :Write ThreadViewCountIncremented event to outbox;
  :Commit interaction transaction;
  :Return 204 No Content;
  :Content Service consumes ThreadViewCountIncremented event;
  :Increment content.threads.view_count (+1);
  stop
endif
@enduml
